      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Immediately notify your shipping line and reefer repair/service provider to arrange for emergency technical assistance or rerouting to a port with immediate repair capabilities. Simultaneously, aim to transfer the cargo to a functioning cold storage unit if possible to slow the temperature rise. Upon arrival, a comprehensive quality assessment, including temperature logging reviews and laboratory testing for microbial load, must be conducted to determine market viability.",
